  "flowAlt": "Data flow: in the browser, devicemotion readings (acceleration with gravity, about 60 a second) are timed for 10 seconds to fix the rate, next to a typed building name, floor and charging box. On the phone, they are resampled to a 100 or 200 Hz grid and FIR-decimated into three bands at 50, 12.5 and 3.125 Hz; a 120-second warm-up checks the phone is flat and levels it, seconds with movement are set aside, and 2048-point windows are averaged into spectra per band. For the user, the page builds one upload schema v1 JSON file of about 200 kB with no location, saves it by download or share sheet, sends nothing itself, and keeps a snapshot in local storage every 60 seconds.",
